    <canvas id="game"></canvas>
  <script type="module" async>var e=Object.defineProperty,t=(e,t,n)=>()=>{if(n)throw n[0];try{return e&&(t=e(e=0)),t}catch(e){throw n=[e],e}},n=(t,n)=>{let r={};for(var i in t)e(r,i,{get:t[i],enumerable:!0});return n||e(r,Symbol.toStringTag,{value:`Module`}),r},r={spec:0,id:`garage-evolution`,title:`Idle Garage Evolution`,listing:{description:`Idle Garage Evolution is an incremental restoration clicker: wrecked cars roll into your garage and you bring them back to life with your own hands. Scrub away the mud, grind the rust hidden under it, spray fresh paint, polish out the scratches, bolt on new parts and start the engine — every layer disappears exactly where you touch, and the finished car flashes its headlights and drives out RESTORED. Buy better tools and robots that you can see working beside you, grow a cramped shed into a workshop, a service station, a luxury showroom and an industrial plant, and collect 142 vehicles in every variant and rarity — from old hatchbacks to hypercars, heavy machines and the first spaceships.

- Satisfying layer-by-layer restoration: mud, dust, soot, rust, paint, polish, parts, engine
- The tool follows the surface: brush, grinder, spray gun, polisher, wrench
- Visible automation: robots that work on their own, also while you are away
- 23 garages on an interactive map: cities around the world, then the Moon and the planets, with spaceships to repair
- A collection album with variants and rarities, a rare car of the day, and full statistics`,controls:`Mouse: click or drag over the car to work on it · Touch: tap or swipe over the car · Keyboard: P pauses · Map: drag to move, pinch or scroll to zoom, tap a garage`,orientation:`both`,tags:[`idle`,`clicker`,`cars`,`incremental`,`satisfying`,`simulation`]},concept:{pitch:`Bring wrecked cars back with your own hands: the car changes layer by layer under your finger (mud, rust, paint, scratches, parts), drives out RESTORED, and the garage grows toward space.`,closest:[`Retro Garage - Car Mechanic`,`Idle Car Service: Tycoon`,`Car Wash - Power Washing Game`],different:`The car is a stack of real layers and a tap works on whatever surface is under the finger: the tool switches itself (brush, grinder, spray, polisher, wrench) and erases exactly where it touches. Retro Garage swaps parts from menus, Idle Car Service never touches a car, power-wash games only wash. Visible robots take over the layers.`,twist:{event:`layer-reveal`,within:30,explained:`Rust under the mud`},progression:`Idle level shop with tiers: tool levels (a sponge becomes a hose, then a pressure washer), robots that appear in the garage and work a layer alone, 23 garages on a map as tiers, each with its own tools and robots earning in the background; a prestige opens space. Second track: a 142-vehicle album.`},story:{depth:`none`,premise:null,file:null,voiced:!1,genre:`idle`},money:{genre:`idle`,session:{minutes:15,breaks:14,breaksAt:`every restored car ends on its RESTORED card → Next car (about one a minute)`},rewarded:[{placement:`double`,kind:`x2`,per:`run`,gives:`Double the payout of the car just restored (offered on every fourth card and on rare cars)`},{placement:`offline`,kind:`boost`,per:`session`,gives:`Double what the robots earned while you were away`}],meta:{minutes:40},returns:{kind:`daily`,what:`a rare car of the day waits at the gate (shown on the title), every robot earns while you are awa